@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title Report 3 Screen Flow — Feature-004, 011, 012 and 013 Baseline
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

|Guest|
start
:Home / public entry;
if (Browse feature?) then (Ring design)
  :Ring design preview;
  :Protected action;
  :Sign-in;
elseif (Custom request)
  :Custom design entry;
  :Protected action;
  :Sign-in;
elseif (Reviews)
  :Public review list/detail;
  :Write-review action;
  :Sign-in;
else (Consultation)
  :Consultation entry;
  :Sign-in;
endif
stop

|Member|
start
:Member home;
if (Ring design) then (yes)
  :Model/blank selection;
  :Configuration;
  :Save/evaluate;
  :Design evaluation and workshop recommendation;
  :My Ring Designs;
  if (Consultation?) then (yes)
    :Context-linked consultation chat;
  endif
elseif (Design request)
  :Design Request Workspace;
  :Consent and image quality checks;
  :Design Request Details;
  :Read human review status/explanation;
  if (Clarification required?) then (yes)
    :Submit clarification;
  endif
elseif (Review)
  :Eligible Review Sources;
  :Create or edit own review;
  :Public review projection;
else (Consultation)
  :General or context-linked chat;
  :OPEN/CLOSED conversation;
endif
stop

|Staff or Manager|
start
:Role home;
if (Design review) then (yes)
  :Design Review Queue;
  :Design Review Details;
  :Accept, reject or request clarification;
  :Mandatory explanation and audit;
elseif (Review moderation)
  :Review Moderation Queue;
  :Moderation Details;
  :Staff hide / Manager hide-remove-reply;
else (Consultation)
  :Consultation Inbox;
  :Claim/assign/reply/close;
endif
stop

note right
Feature-012 design is not attached to booking.
Feature-004 uses human review only; Feature-011 is public-read/member-write.
end note
@enduml
